        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "온화하고 보호 본능이 강하다. 잎사귀로 된 팔은 거목을 일도양단할 정도로 예리하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "性情溫厚，保護慾強。葉子狀的手臂十分鋒利，足以將大樹一刀兩斷。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est gentil et très protecteur. Ses bras faits de feuilles sont si affûtés qu’ils peuvent trancher un grand arbre d’un seul coup.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses sanftmütige Pokémon hat einen starken Beschützerinstinkt. Ein Hieb seiner scharfen Blattarme genügt, um riesige Bäume zweizuteilen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "De carácter afable y marcado instinto protector. Las hojas de sus brazos son tan afiladas que pueden rebanar un gran árbol con un solo corte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È gentile e ha un forte istinto di protezione. Gli arti fatti di foglie sono così affilati da poter tagliare in due il tronco di un grosso albero.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This gentle Pokémon has strong protective instincts. The leaves on its arms are sharp enough to slice a thick tree in half with one stroke.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
